                    <code class="text-break" style="max-width: calc(100% - 160px);">bc1qa9j2dtqa7ux3c9p5wl9g02rz6lkaj99qkznkm7</code>
                </li>
                <li class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3">
                    <strong class="me-2 text-end" style="min-width:160px;">Ethereum / USDT / USDC:</strong>
                    <code class="text-break" style="max-width: calc(100% - 160px);">0x9514c6Be4998eA634Ae1cf604d209522d2D23055</code>
                </li>
                <li class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3">
                    <strong class="me-2 text-end" style="min-width:160px;">Litecoin (LTC):</strong>
                    <code class="text-break" style="max-width: calc(100% - 160px);">LfUXnFN6goYUoWVtshxhvgCZBWJsH7dah9</code>
                </li>
                <li class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3">
                    <strong class="me-2 text-end" style="min-width:160px;">Solana (SOL):</strong>
                    <code class="text-break" style="max-width: calc(100% - 160px);">GKk25ECU5UEbV54VmXpKKeuWhwoiAZiT8jKCBqfggLum</code>
                </li>
                <li class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3">
                    <strong class="me-2 text-end" style="min-width:160px;">Monero (XMR):</strong>
                    <code class="text-break" style="max-width: calc(100% - 160px);">47cmgoRY3zDguToMZFRZfQdgJ6hPWSsaz1VUp1Jr1cLhFGZatLhyDTCWqXunnYNCazNz4zvzsNXP6KHCHnhZSitJ73WzxpP</code>
