                    <a href="https://ko-fi.com/gatoasti?g=0" target="_blank" class="text-break" style="max-width: calc(100% - 160px);">https://ko-fi.com/gatoasti?g=0</a>
                </li>
                <li class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3">
                    <strong class="me-2 text-end" style="min-width:160px;">Cash App:</strong>
                    <code class="text-break" style="max-width: calc(100% - 160px);">$boxed404</code>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <p class="mt-5">
                <strong>Where your donations go:</strong><br />
                At the end of the month, we will show how every dollar donated goes back into Pekora with invoice proof. 
                All donated money does not go to us and we make <span class="text-decoration-underline">zero profit</span> from Pekora.
